{"id":"a700eb7e844ad3ee","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-nextincremental.md","title":"增量多项式枚举与NEXT-GEN的等价","display":"thm-nextincremental — 增量多项式枚举与NEXT-GEN的等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-nextincremental","aliases":["27-thm-nextincremental"],"display":"thm-nextincremental — 增量多项式枚举与NEXT-GEN的等价","depends_on":["[[27-df-enumerationtime]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.8","source_printed_pages":"626","source_pdf_pages":"650","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-nextincremental"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-nextincremental</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nextincremental — 增量多项式枚举与NEXT-GEN的等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"865d91735afbcff2\" href=\"?note=865d91735afbcff2\" title=\"27-df-enumerationtime\">27-df-enumerationtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"626"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"650"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa\">\\(D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4de10af6b469ac9\" href=\"?note=f4de10af6b469ac9\" title=\"27-df-enumerationproblem\">27-df-enumerationproblem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"865d91735afbcff2\" href=\"?note=865d91735afbcff2\" title=\"27-df-enumerationtime\">27-df-enumerationtime</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_N\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_N\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_N\\)</span> 使用该定义的本目录上游接口。合法 NEXT 机器集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\)</span> 与运行时间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{N,\\kappa}\">\\(T_{N,\\kappa}\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\;\n\\left(((w,K),v)\\in\\mathrm{Next}_D\\land\n(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K),\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_N\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\;\n\\left(((w,K),v)\\in\\mathrm{Next}_D\\land\n(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K),\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_N\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_N(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K))\n\\quad(N\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_N(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K))\n\\quad(N\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|&lt;\\infty).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\exists N\\in\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\nT_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\le q(|w|+|K|+1)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\exists N\\in\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\nT_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\le q(|w|+|K|+1)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从空 K 迭代 NEXT，每次有效输出都在 S_D(w)\\K 中，加入后不会重复；结束标记只在 K=S_D(w) 时允许，收到后停机。解长有统一多项式界，前 k 次编码、比较、更新与机器模拟的总开销是 |w|+k 的多项式；最终标记调用同样满足界。</p>\n<p>反向模拟合法增量枚举器，检查每个输出是否属于输入 K；遇到首个不属于 K 的解便返回其带标签码。若已有 |K|+1 个不同输出，至少一个不在 K；若在此前完成枚举，则检查后的全部输出都在 K，结合 K⊆S_D(w) 得 K=S_D(w)，返回结束码。增量输出界与最终停机界分别控制这两种情形。指定输出态和带前缀可以在现有 TM 中以多项式开销模拟。所有比较都作用于显式字串码，空字串也作为普通解参与比较。本条补齐算法载体与运行时间的形式接口，保持原等价结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-enumerationtime","status":"resolved","id":"865d91735afbcff2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-enumerationtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-enumerationproblem","status":"resolved","id":"f4de10af6b469ac9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]；$\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}$、$\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationtime]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Output}_N$、$\\mathrm{Time}_N$ 使用该定义的本目录上游接口。合法 NEXT 机器集合 $\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}$ 与运行时间 $T_{N,\\kappa}$ 由下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-enumerationtime","status":"resolved","id":"865d91735afbcff2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationproblem]]；$\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}$、$\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}$ 见 [[27-df-enumerationtime]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Output}_N$、$\\mathrm{Time}_N$ 使用该定义的本目录上游接口。合法 NEXT 机器集合 $\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}$ 与运行时间 $T_{N,\\kappa}$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\Sigma,\\kappa,\\mathrm{Next}_D,\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Output}_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Time}_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{N,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\\left\\{N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\\exists v\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\;\n\\left(((w,K),v)\\in\\mathrm{Next}_D\\land\n(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K),\\mathrm{NextOutput}_\\kappa(v))\\in\\mathrm{Output}_N\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Time}_N(\\mathrm{NextInput}_\\kappa(w,K))\n\\quad(N\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ K\\subseteq\\Sigma^*,\\ |K|<\\infty).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\mathrm{IncPoly}_{D,\\kappa}(A)\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\\exists N\\in\\mathcal N_{D,\\kappa}\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall K\\subseteq S_D(w)\\;\nT_{N,\\kappa}(w,K)\\le q(|w|+|K|+1)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2763,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-nextincremental|thm-nextincremental — 增量多项式枚举与NEXT-GEN的等价]]"}],"outgoing":["865d91735afbcff2","f4de10af6b469ac9"]}